WEBVTT

00:02.862 --> 00:04.329
Legend has it...

00:05.498 --> 00:08.296
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.635 --> 00:13.800
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.442 --> 00:20.402
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.760 --> 00:41.189
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.468 --> 00:47.304
<i>Rushing through my innocent</i>
<i>youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.842 --> 00:54.747
<i>This soul of mine is</i>
<i>so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.416 --> 01:00.182
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:00.286 --> 01:03.483
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:07.260 --> 01:14.325
<i>This is what I'm wishing</i>
<i>for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.501 --> 01:20.337
<i>I want you to acknowledge</i>
<i>me, that's all.</i>

01:21.207 --> 01:28.477
<i>You smiled at me for</i>
<i>the very first time.</i>

01:28.648 --> 01:37.056
<i>Thank you so much, thank you</i>
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.757 --> 01:39.418
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:49.169 --> 01:52.605
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

02:07.120 --> 02:08.451
I can't believe him!

02:28.241 --> 02:31.210
I'm his Number One Disciple,
and he left me behind...

02:31.511 --> 02:33.945
How could you be so callous, Master?

02:34.547 --> 02:38.347
Oh, by the way, have you ever heard
of someone named Musashi Miyamoto?

02:38.985 --> 02:42.148
Oh, you mean that swordsman
everyone's been talking about?

02:42.255 --> 02:44.951
I heard he destroyed the
Yoshioka School in Kyoto...

02:45.258 --> 02:47.852
But you know how rumors
are always exaggerated...

02:47.961 --> 02:50.691
Anyway, he's sure not
going to show up here.

02:50.830 --> 02:53.731
Our Kuki Musou Style swordplay
would intimidate him too much!

02:56.002 --> 02:56.900
Liars!

02:59.906 --> 03:02.568
Little brat, is your
rudeness intended for us?

03:02.709 --> 03:05.837
That's right, you're a bunch of liars,
so I called you a bunch of liars!

03:05.945 --> 03:06.434
What?

03:06.746 --> 03:08.839
You guys are too incompetent for the...

03:08.948 --> 03:11.348
...great Musashi to
even consider fighting!

03:11.517 --> 03:12.506
Damn you!

03:13.186 --> 03:15.450
Brat, are you related to this Musashi?

03:15.788 --> 03:17.449
Well, don't be surprised...

03:17.790 --> 03:20.224
...but I'm Musashi Miyamoto's
Number One Disciple, Iori!

03:20.493 --> 03:21.187
Really...

03:21.694 --> 03:24.424
If you were just any
brat, I'd let you go.

03:25.198 --> 03:27.166
But since you're a swordsman...

03:27.500 --> 03:31.266
I hope you're aware of the consequences
of ridiculing the Kuki Musou Style!

03:31.371 --> 03:34.135
Why don't we challenge
you to a duel, hmm?

03:34.540 --> 03:37.600
Or is that thing you carry
on your hip just for show?

03:37.777 --> 03:38.675
Huh?

03:39.345 --> 03:40.710
You...

03:43.683 --> 03:44.980
Dammit!

03:49.789 --> 03:50.847
How do you like that?

03:51.224 --> 03:53.556
I can take on your Kuki
Musou Style all by myself!

03:54.394 --> 03:55.326
You're dead, brat!

04:00.333 --> 04:01.095
Bring it on!

04:14.681 --> 04:17.206
Die, you little brat!

04:24.757 --> 04:25.348
Stop!

04:25.992 --> 04:28.654
Come back here, you swine! Why
don't you watch where you're going?

04:29.095 --> 04:29.823
Huh?

04:30.363 --> 04:32.558
It's your own fault
for blocking the bridge.

04:32.865 --> 04:35.766
H-Hey, you're not
leaving me hanging here?

04:35.935 --> 04:37.698
I thought you were my opponent!

04:38.271 --> 04:41.468
Do you know you've insulted
members of the Kuki Musou Style?

04:42.108 --> 04:44.303
Kuki? What the heck is that?

04:44.977 --> 04:47.639
That guy... is he out of his mind?

04:47.747 --> 04:52.707
<i>Reunion</i>

04:57.590 --> 04:58.887
You bastard!

04:59.192 --> 05:00.659
How dare you mock us!

05:33.559 --> 05:34.457
You want more?

05:37.997 --> 05:39.328
Just you wait...

05:45.471 --> 05:47.371
Oh, hey! You forgot this!

05:50.977 --> 05:54.037
Losers! Bunch of blowhards!

05:54.914 --> 05:56.905
Big Brother, you can really kick butt!

06:00.787 --> 06:04.985
You didn't have to jump in and
save me, I could've taken them on myself!

06:05.091 --> 06:07.616
They were bragging that nobody
could beat the Kuki Musou Style...

06:08.261 --> 06:10.525
So I called them liars,
and boy did they get mad...

06:11.130 --> 06:12.028
You listening?

06:12.665 --> 06:13.962
Uh, yeah, this is yummy!

06:15.268 --> 06:18.669
Big Brother, are you
really crazy, after all?

06:18.871 --> 06:20.361
Two more plates of dumplings, please!

06:20.473 --> 06:21.405
No, make that three!

06:21.507 --> 06:22.531
Yes, sir!

06:26.813 --> 06:30.010
Gentlemen, perhaps I'm
speaking out of line here...

06:30.116 --> 06:32.949
...but I think it would be best if
you left town as soon as possible.

06:33.853 --> 06:37.755
Those men you fought belong
to the Dojo run by Kazuma Kuki...

06:37.890 --> 06:40.518
...the swordsmanship
instructor at the Palace.

06:41.060 --> 06:43.290
I'm sure the whole school
will be coming after you!

06:44.130 --> 06:45.154
Big Brother...

06:47.166 --> 06:48.963
I'm still not full yet...

06:49.068 --> 06:49.898
Huh?

06:50.870 --> 06:54.169
Hey, no problem! I'm not afraid
of those weaklings, either!

06:54.407 --> 06:56.705
Oh, please! I did warn you!

06:58.744 --> 07:00.678
Hey Big Brother, what's your name?

07:01.414 --> 07:02.904
My name's Iori!

07:04.217 --> 07:05.184
Iori?

07:05.651 --> 07:06.743
Iori...

07:07.053 --> 07:08.714
I think I've heard that name before...

07:09.188 --> 07:10.212
Yakumo...

07:10.323 --> 07:13.019
My real name is Shiori...

07:16.162 --> 07:17.356
What's the matter?

07:17.797 --> 07:19.890
Nothing, that's a funny name.

07:20.166 --> 07:21.565
F-Funny?

07:22.101 --> 07:23.568
What's your name, then, huh?

07:24.203 --> 07:25.534
Yakumo Mutsu.

07:25.738 --> 07:26.670
What the heck!

07:26.772 --> 07:28.763
Your name's just as funny as mine!

07:28.875 --> 07:32.811
I thought you might be a famous
swordsman, just because you're so powerful!

07:34.046 --> 07:37.277
Well, don't have a heart attack
when you hear who my Master is...

07:37.717 --> 07:40.584
My Master's name is Musashi Miyamoto!

07:40.953 --> 07:42.113
Really...

07:42.955 --> 07:44.047
It's true, you know!

07:44.257 --> 07:46.555
Well, we're not together right now, but...

07:47.326 --> 07:49.988
I'm on my own, and that's
like a pilgrimage, too.

07:50.096 --> 07:54.533
And as soon as I'm good enough
not to get in Musashi's way...

07:58.538 --> 07:59.869
...then I'm going to join him...

07:59.972 --> 08:02.702
...and he's going to teach me
everything he knows about swordsmanship!

08:03.075 --> 08:04.770
Are you surprised or what?

08:05.211 --> 08:06.803
Yes, I'm very surprised...

08:07.079 --> 08:10.537
That you actually want to
learn from such a scary man.

08:11.083 --> 08:12.812
Well, sure he's scary!

08:13.052 --> 08:14.917
But the important
thing is he's powerful!

08:15.021 --> 08:16.921
He's the most powerful
man in all of Japan!

08:17.223 --> 08:19.316
No, he's probably second.

08:19.492 --> 08:21.926
He's not second to
anyone, he's Number One!

08:22.361 --> 08:24.659
Who do you think is more powerful
than the great Musashi?

08:24.764 --> 08:25.924
The Edo Yagyus?

08:26.032 --> 08:27.124
The Itto Style?

08:27.233 --> 08:28.564
Come on, tell me! Who's Number One?

08:30.603 --> 08:31.194
Well, I am.

08:33.573 --> 08:34.437
Oh, come on.

08:34.540 --> 08:39.807
Sure, you're pretty powerful too, but
if you faced Musashi you'd be history!

08:40.212 --> 08:41.110
Maybe you're right.

08:41.213 --> 08:43.579
No maybes about it! Definitely!

08:43.916 --> 08:47.784
All right then, you've got to fight
Musashi if you ever run into him.

08:48.187 --> 08:50.587
No running away, now, swear to me!

08:50.990 --> 08:53.083
If I ever run into him, sure.

08:54.961 --> 08:56.292
Okay, thanks for the meal.

08:56.395 --> 08:57.419
Sure.

08:57.563 --> 08:59.861
Thank you sirs, that will be fifteen mon.

09:00.800 --> 09:03.325
Hey, don't leave without paying, you!

09:04.270 --> 09:05.202
Why not?

09:05.471 --> 09:07.371
I don't have a single mon on me.

09:07.506 --> 09:09.804
I hadn't eaten in three days.

09:10.009 --> 09:12.307
That's no reason to
stick me with the bill!

09:12.745 --> 09:14.975
But hey, I saved your life.

09:15.348 --> 09:17.282
Whenever I save someone,
that means I can eat.

09:17.717 --> 09:19.412
Come on, I'm broke too!

09:21.954 --> 09:23.080
Excuse me!

09:23.589 --> 09:25.386
Fifteen mon, right?

09:26.993 --> 09:28.187
Well, thank you very much!

09:34.100 --> 09:37.263
You're always strapped
for cash, aren't you?

09:38.971 --> 09:40.131
Do you know her?

09:40.239 --> 09:44.232
Yes, I helped her out once,
and she paid for my lunch.

09:44.977 --> 09:46.444
Are you a fool?

09:46.545 --> 09:48.012
Don't tell me you've left your fief...

09:48.114 --> 09:50.548
I was born a fool, it can't be cured...

09:51.017 --> 09:53.008
I can't believe that
old Matabei let you...

09:55.054 --> 09:56.112
Jii...

09:56.522 --> 09:58.285
Jii became ill, and passed away...

10:00.159 --> 10:01.421
I see...

10:01.894 --> 10:03.862
So he's gone now, that old man...

10:04.096 --> 10:06.428
...but that's no
reason for you to leave.

10:07.466 --> 10:11.334
Before the mourning period was even
over, my uncle tried to marry me off.

10:11.704 --> 10:16.004
He tried to send me to a strange land
as the bride of a boy who's not even ten!

10:16.575 --> 10:19.066
He wanted to use me as a political tool...

10:20.046 --> 10:21.035
Bride?

10:21.180 --> 10:22.579
So she's a girl?

10:23.082 --> 10:26.017
But really, Yakumo is
the perfect name for you.

10:26.752 --> 10:30.518
You float about just like a
cloud, how I've searched for you!

10:34.360 --> 10:35.793
I've been searching
for you all this time!

10:38.531 --> 10:39.896
It was so hard for me...

10:40.299 --> 10:41.789
I missed you so much...

10:41.967 --> 10:43.366
What did you expect?

10:43.803 --> 10:46.397
You idiot, you should've
just gotten married...

10:46.806 --> 10:50.003
Uh, he didn't have to say it like that...

10:50.109 --> 10:50.973
Out of the way!

10:51.077 --> 10:52.135
Coming through!

10:53.045 --> 10:54.273
Move out of the way!

10:56.982 --> 10:58.973
I was curious to see
what this man looked like...

10:59.085 --> 11:00.746
But I guess we've caught him off guard!

11:01.887 --> 11:04.082
Who in the world are these people?

11:04.457 --> 11:06.220
They must be with
those jerks from before...

11:06.559 --> 11:08.459
You seem to be occupied at the moment...

11:08.561 --> 11:10.688
...but please accompany us to the Dojo.

11:13.365 --> 11:14.696
Only if you serve us refreshments.

11:15.134 --> 11:15.930
Are you mocking us?

11:16.035 --> 11:17.593
Assistant Instructor,
let's take him here!

11:19.004 --> 11:20.437
If you so wish...

11:21.140 --> 11:23.040
I told them they should get out of town...

11:23.576 --> 11:26.374
He could've just gotten
off with a broken arm...

11:26.479 --> 11:29.209
...but it looks like they
might end up killing him...

11:29.348 --> 11:31.043
And he asked for refreshments!

11:31.150 --> 11:34.586
Even if he is somewhat skilled,
he must be out of his mind...

11:34.720 --> 11:37.780
No, I bet he really thinks he's
going to be served refreshments!

11:39.492 --> 11:40.720
What is going on here?

11:40.826 --> 11:42.259
Going on? Haven't you...

11:46.332 --> 11:47.697
Y-Your Highness!

11:47.800 --> 11:49.791
I didn't realize it was
you, please forgive me!

11:50.269 --> 11:52.567
Never mind, I'm asking what is going on?

11:53.305 --> 11:54.829
Yes, well...

11:54.974 --> 11:59.035
Those Kuki disciples have taken a
young traveler away to their Dojo!

11:59.578 --> 12:03.036
Really? The disciples of the
Kuki School grabbed a traveler...

12:03.949 --> 12:05.644
Good thing we left the
Palace grounds today!

12:05.751 --> 12:07.275
That sounds like the perfect diversion!

12:08.387 --> 12:09.411
Well, come on, then!

12:09.855 --> 12:11.652
Get a move on, or I'll
have to leave you there!

12:12.458 --> 12:14.221
P-Princess!

12:24.236 --> 12:26.136
<i>Japan's Greatest Sword School</i>

12:26.205 --> 12:28.139
<i>Kuki Musou Style Dojo</i>

12:32.645 --> 12:35.944
I'd like to thank you for
coming here without resisting.

12:36.248 --> 12:41.379
Normally, the Master himself would
address you, but unfortunately he is out.

12:42.521 --> 12:47.356
Therefore I, his third son, Shinzaburo
Kuki, shall speak in his place.

12:48.027 --> 12:49.255
Where are the refreshments?

12:51.463 --> 12:54.728
As soon as we are finished
here, you shall be served.

12:56.001 --> 12:58.629
I hear that several of my men
caused you some trouble earlier...

12:59.305 --> 13:02.763
Well, I'm sure they
got what they deserved...

13:03.509 --> 13:05.977
The Kuki Musou Style
School is charged with...

13:06.045 --> 13:09.139
...teaching swordsmanship to the family
of the distinguished Lord Fukushima...

13:09.248 --> 13:12.445
...and God forbid that
students from our Dojo would...

13:12.551 --> 13:16.544
...attack an unarmed man in broad daylight
three-to-one, and still be defeated.

13:17.189 --> 13:23.185
Though they are of low rank,
we can't have any tall tales...

13:23.295 --> 13:25.456
Forget the preamble. Let's just do it!

13:26.365 --> 13:27.354
Yakumo?

13:27.800 --> 13:28.858
Who's my opponent?

13:30.736 --> 13:33.830
Well! Since we're on the
same page, let's begin.

13:34.773 --> 13:39.039
Your opponent will be Aoki, who serves
as Assistant Instructor at this Dojo.

13:44.717 --> 13:46.378
B-Big Brother...

13:46.785 --> 13:48.776
Let's get this over with so we can eat!

13:48.921 --> 13:52.186
Are you crazy? I can't believe
you're still going on about that!

13:52.324 --> 13:54.258
You haven't changed at all, I see!

13:54.860 --> 13:56.225
Never mind, just step back.

14:00.099 --> 14:00.997
Big Brother!

14:11.110 --> 14:13.578
Aren't you supposed to be watching
the gate? Return to your post!

14:15.114 --> 14:16.342
Princess Yuki!

14:19.718 --> 14:21.709
So that's the young traveler...

14:22.121 --> 14:24.681
I don't know where your expertise lies...

14:24.823 --> 14:27.690
...but we have no intention of
beating up an unarmed man.

14:28.427 --> 14:30.691
Pick your poison, whatever you want.

14:32.998 --> 14:36.559
You can even draw that sword
of yours, too, if you like.

14:37.136 --> 14:38.330
Anything I want?

14:39.104 --> 14:39.934
Yes.

14:42.308 --> 14:43.297
Then I'll use this.

14:44.543 --> 14:46.272
Bastard!

14:46.712 --> 14:48.236
This should be just fine.

14:48.914 --> 14:50.882
A dumpling skewer?

14:51.050 --> 14:53.780
Big Brother! You better not be bluffing!

14:53.886 --> 14:55.854
Even for you, Yakumo,
that's going too far!

14:56.221 --> 14:57.017
Stop clowning around!

14:57.122 --> 14:58.248
He's mocking us!

14:58.390 --> 15:00.824
He can't get away with
that kind of attitude!

15:01.493 --> 15:02.460
Shut up!

15:02.661 --> 15:03.320
But...

15:03.462 --> 15:04.429
Young Sensei!

15:04.630 --> 15:07.690
He's going to take on the Kuki
Musou Style with a dumpling skewer!

15:07.900 --> 15:08.924
That's an insult!

15:09.368 --> 15:10.266
Shut up!

15:12.638 --> 15:14.128
I'm not clowning around at all.

15:14.640 --> 15:17.973
If that's your chosen
weapon, then I'll allow it.

15:18.077 --> 15:20.910
But you are not to make
any excuses when you lose!

15:21.280 --> 15:24.909
You are to wield the sword of the Kuki
Musou Style at your full power.

15:25.084 --> 15:28.212
I have permission to kill, you mean.

15:36.462 --> 15:37.087
Begin!

15:53.145 --> 15:54.942
Is that man a complete idiot?

15:55.147 --> 15:57.547
He doesn't have a chance
with that little skewer...

15:57.983 --> 15:59.541
He's going to get himself killed...

16:51.470 --> 16:52.368
Aoki!

16:52.771 --> 16:53.601
He won!

16:53.739 --> 16:55.502
He actually won with just a skewer!

17:00.946 --> 17:03.244
It looks like you favor long swords...

17:03.682 --> 17:07.379
...but the longer the sword, the easier
it is to dodge and then blindside you!

17:08.087 --> 17:09.111
That's all there is to it.

17:20.666 --> 17:21.360
Yakumo!

17:22.267 --> 17:24.531
You did it, Big Brother!

17:24.703 --> 17:27.035
It started off a little shaky, but...

17:27.439 --> 17:27.996
Yakumo!

17:28.507 --> 17:30.475
You almost gave me a heart attack again!

17:31.477 --> 17:32.444
Really?

17:35.981 --> 17:37.949
Hey, that's really low!

17:38.050 --> 17:40.018
He fought you fair and square and won!

17:41.019 --> 17:44.614
No one ever said there was
only going to be one match.

17:45.090 --> 17:47.524
And who said anything
about fighting one-on-one?

17:47.659 --> 17:48.819
No one.

17:50.362 --> 17:51.829
He didn't sign up for this...

17:52.297 --> 17:54.561
If that's the case, then
I'm going to help out!

17:55.467 --> 17:57.162
Both of you, step back.

18:24.630 --> 18:25.654
Yakumo...

18:44.983 --> 18:46.814
A-Awesome...

18:47.953 --> 18:50.148
Well, but you're not quite
as good as Musashi, of course...

18:50.489 --> 18:51.786
Wow!

19:21.520 --> 19:22.544
Stop it right now!

19:25.724 --> 19:27.988
Princess Yuki!

19:31.797 --> 19:33.992
Princess Yuki, what are you doing here?

19:34.399 --> 19:35.593
This is disgraceful.

19:35.701 --> 19:38.465
And you call yourselves
instructors of the Kuki School?

19:40.405 --> 19:43.272
The Assistant Instructor was
defeated in an official duel.

19:43.375 --> 19:47.072
I will not allow you to seek
revenge by ganging up on this man!

19:47.479 --> 19:49.538
I hope I've made myself
clear, Shinzaburo.

19:50.749 --> 19:51.511
Yes...

19:51.750 --> 19:55.015
If you say so, Princess Yuki,
then this matter is closed.

19:57.589 --> 19:58.681
Young Sensei!

19:58.790 --> 20:01.315
If we withdraw now, the
Kuki name will be tarnished!

20:01.426 --> 20:02.393
Young Sensei!

20:03.629 --> 20:05.221
For the Kuki name...

20:05.330 --> 20:10.893
Not one man bearing the Kuki name
has been defeated by this man yet...

20:11.003 --> 20:13.904
...make sure you remember that!

20:14.873 --> 20:16.534
Please, you should go now...

20:16.842 --> 20:19.208
I appreciate your offer,
but I can't accept...

20:20.178 --> 20:22.043
What are you talking about, Yakumo?

20:23.615 --> 20:26.015
Big Brother, come on,
let's get out of here!

20:26.585 --> 20:28.416
I still have some
unfinished business.

20:28.987 --> 20:30.079
Unfinished business?

20:30.188 --> 20:31.212
What the hell?

20:31.356 --> 20:32.084
Well...

20:32.557 --> 20:34.548
...I haven't been served those
refreshments you promised!

20:35.827 --> 20:36.816
Refreshments?

20:48.006 --> 20:48.995
I like this man!

20:49.107 --> 20:50.404
Come with me, to my palace.

20:51.043 --> 20:53.136
I'll serve you as many
refreshments as you want...

20:53.612 --> 20:55.671
We're taking these people home with us!

20:55.781 --> 20:56.213
Yes, Princess!

21:01.653 --> 21:03.416
W-Wait up, Big Brother!

21:04.156 --> 21:06.147
Don't just stand there, let's go!

21:06.491 --> 21:07.753
Uh, okay...

21:18.670 --> 21:21.639
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.784 --> 21:44.821
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at</i>
<i>them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:45.097 --> 21:54.836
<i>My loneliness and the vast night</i>
<i>sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.973 --> 22:03.972
<i>I just don't know what this</i>
<i>dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:04.116 --> 22:14.788
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"</i>
<i>I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.827 --> 22:21.959
<i>The person I am today</i>
<i>is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.334 --> 22:25.326
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:26.204 --> 22:32.473
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.778 --> 22:38.273
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:53.932 --> 22:57.129
Discovering Yakumo's
insurmountable power...

22:57.335 --> 22:59.826
...Shinzaburo turns to
underhanded tactics to trap him.

23:00.806 --> 23:04.298
Next episode of the Age of
Chaos, "The Shadows Strike."

23:04.743 --> 23:06.404
Pay close attention, and wait!
